      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "房间敌人物品规则每局重组",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Rooms, enemies, items, and modifiers are procedurally generated every run.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/655740/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "本地同屏与在线四人共闯地牢",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Couch Co-op (local shared screen, up to 4 players) Online Co-op (up to 4 players per game)",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/655740/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
  "opinions": [
    {
      "text": "约每30分钟就会崩溃。",
      "dimension": "技术/性能",
      "source": "玩家观点",
      "polarity": "需留意",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "excerpt": "This thing crashes every 30 minutes or so.",
          "url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/KrudlerTheHorse/recommended/655740/",
          "label": "证据原文片段"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "武器看似多样，但实际种类比前作更少。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "source": "玩家观点",
      "polarity": "需留意",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "excerpt": "武器看起来种类繁多，但实际上2代的武器种类居然远远少于1代。",
          "url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/wheekghost/recommended/655740/",
          "label": "证据原文片段"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "装备获取过度依赖运气。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "source": "玩家观点",
      "polarity": "需留意",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "excerpt": "装备的获取和运气成分过大",
          "url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198139731591/recommended/655740/",
          "label": "证据原文片段"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "稳定性仍需大量改进。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "source": "玩家观点",
      "polarity": "需留意",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "excerpt": "still needs a lot of work in stability and balancing with the weapons",
          "url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/KrudlerTheHorse/recommended/655740/",
          "label": "证据原文片段"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "武器平衡仍需大量改进。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "source": "玩家观点",
      "polarity": "需留意",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "excerpt": "still needs a lot of work in stability and balancing with the weapons",
          "url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/KrudlerTheHorse/recommended/655740/",
          "label": "证据原文片段"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "战斗非常令人满意。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "source": "玩家观点",
      "polarity": "喜欢",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "excerpt": "the combat is beyond satisfying",
          "url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/gnomeonsteam/recommended/655740/",
          "label": "证据原文片段"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "武器额外冲击感让连招手感很好。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "source": "玩家观点",
      "polarity": "喜欢",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "excerpt": "almost all weapons have an extra punch that makes your combos feel extremely good",
          "url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/gnomeonsteam/recommended/655740/",
          "label": "证据原文片段"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "没有局外成长，依靠玩家自身进步的设计令人耳目一新。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "source": "玩家观点",
      "polarity": "喜欢",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "excerpt": "[b]There’s no meta-progression[/b], which is very refreshing",
          "url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/gnomeonsteam/recommended/655740/",
          "label": "证据原文片段"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "死亡通常源于玩家自身失误，而非随机或廉价死亡。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "source": "玩家观点",
      "polarity": "喜欢",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "excerpt": "when the death comes, it’s all their fault – and this is simply beautiful: no random BS or cheap deaths. It’s al",
          "url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/gnomeonsteam/recommended/655740/",
          "label": "证据原文片段"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "操控自由且游戏轻松爽快。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "source": "玩家观点",
      "polarity": "喜欢",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "excerpt": "优点是操控自由，游戏很轻松，爽快爆瓜",
          "url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198139731591/recommended/655740/",
          "label": "证据原文片段"
        }
